  "title": "Mince Pies",
  "description": "These mince pies are sweet and delicious, filled with homemade mincemeat made with dried fruit and spices for a traditional British Christmas treat!",
  "authors": [
    "Emmas Delicious Eats"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-01-09T05:18:25-05:00",
